* GPSS Data Processing Utility Tool
* Simulates a data processing pipeline with ingestion, processing, and storage phases.

* Define Constants
PARAMETER NUM_RECORDS, 1000
PARAMETER BUFFER_SIZE, 50
PARAMETER PROCESS_TIME_MIN, 0.005
PARAMETER PROCESS_TIME_MAX, 0.020

* Define Transmitters/Receivers
DEFINE INGEST_TRANSMITTER, TRANSMITTER
DEFINE PROCESS_TRANSMITTER, TRANSMITTER
DEFINE STORAGE_RECEIVER, RECEIVER

* Define Resources
DEFINE DATA_BUFFER, STORAGE, BUFFER_SIZE
DEFINE CPU, RESOURCE, 1

* Simulation Start
START NUM_RECORDS

* Phase 1: Data Ingestion
LOOP START LOOP1 NUM_RECORDS
   GENERATE 0.01, 0.005, 0.005
   * Record enters simulation
   TRACE 'Record Generated'
   
   * Check for available buffer space
   TEST DATA_BUFFER, 1, 1
   * If no space, wait (optional: could drop or block)
   BLOCK DATA_BUFFER
   
   * Add record to buffer
   ADVANCE 0.002
   
   * Release buffer space for next record
   RELEASE DATA_BUFFER
LOOP1 HOLD 1

* Phase 2: Data Processing
LOOP START LOOP2 1
   * Retrieve record from buffer
   TRACE 'Record Sent to Processor'
   
   * Acquire CPU resource
   SEIZE CPU
   
   * Simulate variable processing time
   ADVANCE PROCESS_TIME_MIN, PROCESS_TIME_MAX, 0
   
   * Release CPU
   RELEASE CPU
   
   * Store result (optional: simulate persistence)
   TRACE 'Record Processed'
LOOP2 HOLD 1

* Phase 3: Cleanup and Termination
LOOP START LOOP3 NUM_RECORDS
   * Simulate post-processing delay
   ADVANCE 0.001
   
   * Release resources (if any)
   TRACE 'Record Cleaned Up'
LOOP3 HOLD 1

* Simulation End
TERMINATE 1

* Initialization of Resources
RESOURCE CPU, 1, 1, 1, 1
STORAGE DATA_BUFFER, BUFFER_SIZE

* End of Simulation
END
